#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/nodes/Working-with-nodes/Learning-About-Logging/Learning-About-Logging.rst:14
msgid ""
"Log messages report what a node is doing, and each message has a severity "
"level. This tutorial teaches you to write a small battery monitor node that "
"logs at different severities, then use the ROS CLI to show or hide those "
"messages. After completing it, you will be able to control which log "
"severities appear with ``--log-level``."
msgstr ""

