msgid "Summary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/nodes/Working-with-nodes/Learning-About-Logging/Learning-About-Logging.rst:29
msgid ""
"ROS nodes use log messages to report status and problems. Severity levels, "
"from least to most severe, are ``DEBUG``, ``INFO``, ``WARN``, ``ERROR``, and "
"``FATAL``. By default, a node prints ``INFO`` and above. Use ``--ros-args --"
"log-level`` to change which severities are shown when you run a node."
msgstr ""

