"name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/nodes/Working-with-nodes/Learning-About-Logging/Learning-About-Logging.rst:152
msgid ""
"Navigate one level up to the package root, where ``setup.py`` and "
"``package.xml`` were created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/nodes/Working-with-nodes/Learning-About-Logging/Learning-About-Logging.rst:154
msgid "Open ``setup.py``, then replace the console script entry:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/nodes/Working-with-nodes/Learning-About-Logging/Learning-About-Logging.rst:156
msgid ""
"entry_points={\n"
"    'console_scripts': [\n"
"        'battery_monitor = battery_logging.battery_monitor:main',\n"
"    ],\n"
"},"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/nodes/Working-with-nodes/Learning-About-Logging/Learning-About-Logging.rst:164
msgid "Save the file."
msgstr ""

